 Animations","target":"http://www.designersnotebook.com/Columns/117_Bad_Game_Designer_XIII/animatio117_bad_game_designer_xiii.htm","line":169},{"title":"Low-Poly Trees","target":"http://www.designersnotebook.com/Columns/044_Bad_Game_Designer_3/lowpoly044_bad_game_designer_3.htm","line":170},{"title":"Too Few Audio Clips for a Given Situation","target":"http://www.designersnotebook.com/Columns/044_Bad_Game_Designer_3/audio044_bad_game_designer_3.htm","line":171},{"title":"Bad Translation and Localization","target":"http://www.designersnotebook.com/Columns/083_Bad_Game_Designer_VII/translat083_bad_game_designer_vii.htm","line":172},{"title":"Time-Constrained Demos","target":"http://www.designersnotebook.com/Columns/097_Bad_Game_Designer_IX/time097_bad_game_designer_ix.htm","line":173},{"title":"Obvious and Cheap Reskins (Cookie-Cutter Games)","target":"http://www.designersnotebook.com/Columns/097_Bad_Game_Designer_IX/reskins097_bad_game_designer_ix.htm","line":174},{"title":"Extreme Changes of Brightness or Sound","target":"http://www.designersnotebook.com/Columns/117_Bad_Game_Designer_XIII/extreme117_bad_game_designer_xiii.htm","line":175},{"title":"Mocking the Player","target":"http://www.designersnotebook.com/Columns/103_Bad_Game_Designer_X/mocking103_bad_game_designer_x.htm","line":176},{"title":"Hiding All Your Best Content Behind A Paywall","target":"http://www.designersnotebook.com/Columns/117_Bad_Game_Designer_XIII/hiding117_bad_game_designer_xiii.htm","line":180}],"metadata":{"created":"2022-05-25T23:30:45 (UTC +08:00)","tags":[],"source":"http://www.designersnotebook.com/Design_Resources/No_Twinkie_Database/no_twinkie_database.htm","author":"Ernest W. Adams"}},
