 NPCs","target":"http://www.designersnotebook.com/Columns/117_Bad_Game_Designer_XIII/indiscre117_bad_game_designer_xiii.htm","line":145},{"title":"Neat, Tidy Explosions","target":"http://www.designersnotebook.com/Columns/005_Bad_Game_Designer_1/explosio005_bad_game_designer_1.htm","line":146},{"title":"Huge Breasts and Other Juvenilia","target":"http://www.designersnotebook.com/Columns/029_Bad_Game_Designer_2/juvenili029_bad_game_designer_2.htm","line":147},{"title":"Overlong, Predictable Animations","target":"http://www.designersnotebook.com/Columns/117_Bad_Game_Designer_XIII/animatio117_bad_game_designer_xiii.htm","line":148},{"title":"Low-Poly Trees","target":"http://www.designersnotebook.com/Columns/044_Bad_Game_Designer_3/lowpoly044_bad_game_designer_3.htm","line":149},{"title":"Too Few Audio Clips for a Given Situation","target":"http://www.designersnotebook.com/Columns/044_Bad_Game_Designer_3/audio044_bad_game_designer_3.htm","line":150},{"title":"Bad Translation and Localization","target":"http://www.designersnotebook.com/Columns/083_Bad_Game_Designer_VII/translat083_bad_game_designer_vii.htm","line":151},{"title":"Time-Constrained Demos","target":"http://www.designersnotebook.com/Columns/097_Bad_Game_Designer_IX/time097_bad_game_designer_ix.htm","line":152},{"title":"Obvious and Cheap Reskins (Cookie-Cutter Games)","target":"http://www.designersnotebook.com/Columns/097_Bad_Game_Designer_IX/reskins097_bad_game_designer_ix.htm","line":153},{"title":"Extreme Changes of Brightness or Sound","target":"http://www.designersnotebook.com/Columns/117_Bad_Game_Designer_XIII/extreme117_bad_game_designer_xiii.htm","line":154},{"title":"Mocking the Player","target":"http://www.designersnotebook.com/Columns/103_Bad_Game_Designer_X/mocking103_bad_game_designer_x.htm","line":155},{"title":"Hiding All Your Best Content Behind A Paywall","target":"http://www.designersnotebook.com/Columns/117_Bad_Game_Designer_XIII/hiding117_bad_game_designer_xiii.htm","line":159}],"class_name